# GludioHold's static-object clan-attacked hook on a knight of Gludio Castle (35066,
# GludioKnight) of the clan door_clan, standing by a gate (Gludio's outer gate's id,
# 19210001): a hit on a door calls the door clan's NPCs within 600 of it. The character's hit
# on the gate for a twentieth of the knight's 440 hit points makes it want to attack the
# character by 50. No siege runs: the gate loses no hit points, but its call goes out.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
door gate 19210001 100 0 0
npc knight 35066 SiegeGuard 100 200 0 walks clan door_clan 300

hit gate 22
  hate knight 50
  desires knight attack(player)=50
